title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/kmtrally.jpg

@main_rally

Mass rallies can be held to spread our messages to the masses. What are we going to talk about today?

- @common_folk: Teaching the workers and peasants about our movement.
- @middle: Attracting the literate to support our party.
- @democracy: Our goal of democracy against the Northern Warlords.
- @war: Recruiting men to the NRA.
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@common_folk
on-arrival: workers_kmt += 4*(1-dissent); rural_kmt += 4*(1-dissent); old_middle_kmt -= 3; new_middle_kmt -= 2;

Our messages give the people hope for rights and a living.

@middle
on-arrival: old_middle_kmt += 4*(1-dissent); new_middle_kmt += 4*(1-dissent)

The reformist message appeals to the people who have studied in university or abroad and know the backwards-ness of the warlord government.

@democracy
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5*(1 - dissent);

Our speakers send messages rallying for Sun Yat-sen's democratic ideals and the participation of people in their government.

@local
on-arrival: workers_kmt += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_kmt += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_kmt += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kmt += 3*(1-dissent); rural_kmt += 5*(1-dissent)

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the people in this moment.
